\b Street Corsa\b0\par\par
Street Corsa is a fan-made game that runs on top of Assetto Corsa, which you need to own and have installed. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Kunos Simulazioni or 505 Games. Before each race it changes the data of the car you race in your Assetto Corsa install and puts it back afterwards; it also installs its race modes for Custom Shaders Patch there. Uninstalling Street Corsa takes those modes out again. Your saves and settings stay in %AppData%\\StreetCorsa.\par\par
Privacy: Street Corsa sends nothing over the network unless you ask it to: no telemetry, no update check, no account. The one exception is the optional AI writer, off until you turn it on in the game's Settings (and off again there whenever you like). Once it is on, the game sends the AI provider you pick what it needs to write the newspaper's and the people's lines: what you type to the people you talk to, your offers when you haggle, and your career as the talk needs it (the cars, racers and places, your money, cars, parts and prices, earlier talks). With Ollama or ComfyUI on your own computer it stays there; with a cloud service (an OpenAI-compatible one or Anthropic, under your own key) it goes to that service, under its privacy policy. The full policy: https://github.com/streetcorsamods/street-corsa#privacy\par\par
